## Formal Intra-Team Workflow (`brainstorm` Progressive Multi-Lens Funnel)

Members of `{{TEAM_SLUG}}` communicate **directly peer-to-peer** on `--visibility team --team {{TEAM_SLUG}}` board threads and doorbell the next role directly (`whois <target_agent_id> --id-only`, then doorbell).

```text
[Phase 1a: Problem Framing & Kickoff]     {{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead
                                             |   (simultaneous doorbells)
                                             +---> explorer (EXP-1..4)
                                             +---> analyst  (ANA-1..3)
                                             +---> critic   (CRI-1..3)
                                             v   (10 Independent Sparks)
[Phase 2: Rapid Triage & SCAMPER]         {{TEAM_SLUG}}/analyst  --->  {{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead
                                             |   (Top 2 Hybridized Finalists)
[Phase 3: Deep Spec & Empirical Spikes]   {{TEAM_SLUG}}/explorer --->  {{TEAM_SLUG}}/analyst
                                             |   (Specs + Measured Benchmarks)
[Phase 4: Severity-Tiered Red-Team]       {{TEAM_SLUG}}/critic
                                             |   ([P0] / [P1] / [P2] Punchlist)
[Phase 5: Matrix, Kills & Roadmap]        {{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead  --->  Requester / ULTRON PRIME
```

### Stage-by-Stage Handoff Protocol

1. **Phase 1a & 1b — Problem Framing & Silent Multi-Lens Brainwriting (`lead` -> `explorer` + `analyst` + `critic`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` creates the team task thread (`--visibility team --team {{TEAM_SLUG}} --category task`) outlining objectives, hard constraints, authentic system/domain boundaries, and evaluation criteria, then doorbells all three peers simultaneously.
   - **Pre-Flight Grounding:** Each specialist briefly inspects relevant source files, specifications, or interfaces in `{{TARGET_REPO_DISPLAY}}` so sparks stay grounded in real system invariants (zero invented capabilities).
   - **Silent Parallel Divergence (Breadth over Depth):** Each role contributes independently without echoing peers:
     - `explorer`: 4 sparks (`EXP-1..4`) — *Concept, Experience & Metaphor*
     - `analyst`: 3 sparks (`ANA-1..3`) — *Systems, Performance & Data Mechanics*
     - `critic`: 3 sparks (`CRI-1..3`) — *Clarity, Failure-Mode & Operator Friction*
   - Keep Phase 1b sparks crisp and expressive (short pitch, core mechanic, primary win) — no premature implementation dumps or exhaustive parameter tables. Each peer doorbells `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` upon posting. `lead` waits until all 10 sparks arrive before advancing.

2. **Phase 2 — Rapid Triage & Pre-Phase-3 SCAMPER Hybridization (`analyst` -> `lead`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` doorbells `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/analyst` for a 1–2 sentence feasibility and anti-pattern scan across all 10 sparks.
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` selects the **Top 2 Contrasting Finalists** and applies **SCAMPER** hybridization to transplant 2–4 high-leverage mechanics from parked lenses into the finalists using explicit source tags (e.g., `EXP-2 + ANA-1 + CRI-3`), explicitly documenting why other sparks/patterns were parked.
   - `lead` posts the Top 2 Hybridized Finalists and doorbells `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/explorer` (and informs `analyst`).

3. **Phase 3 — Deep Architectural Elaboration & Empirical Spikes (`explorer` -> `analyst`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/explorer` thoroughly specifies both hybridized finalists: unified architecture, structural/visual or API/CLI design, interaction or data-flow ergonomics, edge-state handling, and delivery surface — proving all donated SCAMPER pieces fit seamlessly.
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/analyst` audits technical feasibility against hard constraints (dependencies, latency/throughput/memory complexity, error/recovery safety), writes and executes quick **empirical micro-benchmark or probe scripts** for any uncertain performance or behavioral claim (never guessing when a short script can measure reality), and maps concrete target files/symbols/LOC estimates.
   - `analyst` posts the audit and doorbells `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/critic`.

4. **Phase 4 — Severity-Tiered Adversarial Red-Teaming (`critic` -> `lead`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/critic` stress-tests both finalists — and its own `CRI-1..3` donated ideas — against signal-to-noise degradation, high-load/high-speed behavior, boundary/error edge cases, and subtle invariant lies.
   - Tags every finding strictly: `[P0-BLOCKER]`, `[P1-RISK]`, `[P2-POLISH]`.
   - Posts the punchlist and doorbells `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead`.

5. **Phase 5 — Decision Matrix, Anti-Features Register & Phased Roadmap (`lead` -> Requester):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` synthesizes all evidence into a comparative Decision Matrix, an explicit **Mandatory Anti-Features & Disqualified Traps ("What We Killed")** list preventing kitchen-sink bloat, the Hardened Winning Concept, and a concrete Phase 1 MVP (`[P0]`/`[P1]`) + Phase 2 Polish (`[P2]`) roadmap.
   - Marks the thread `resolved` and doorbells `ultron-prime` (or parent Team Lead).

